He looked perplexed ... and out of the blue, he turned around and walked out of the room. He didn't even ask how I was!\nSuddenly, a bright light appeared over my bed and a ghostly figure was emanating from it. I had read up on this hospital and heard rumors that it was haunted, but I couldn't believe what I was seeing! The ghost had fangs, but it wasn't scary ... just bizarre."}, {"time": "55000", "image": "engenn8le11ob11re2img01.jpg", "id": 3, "text": "She may have been a vampire ghost, or she might have been all in my head. To this day, I still don't know what really happened.\nThe doctor returned and said \u201cYou look like you've seen a ghost! You must be feeling a little disorientated after the surgery. I could get the nurse\u201d. <br/>\nThat was the last I saw of my doctor! I won't put up with that kind of treatment again!"}]}}], "id": 1}], "id": 0}], "type": "sena"}